WEBVTT

00:10:29.205 --> 00:10:31.868
between language and social categories

00:10:31.892 --> 00:10:35.310
and will have questioned their assumptions
about what it really means

00:10:35.334 --> 00:10:37.536
to be a speaker of a language.

00:10:38.121 --> 00:10:39.449
Thank you.

00:10:39.473 --> 00:10:41.243
(Applause)